%% State — room request
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pending : checks pass
  Pending --> Approved : admin of an owning dept approves
  Pending --> Rejected : admin rejects
  Pending --> Rejected : another request for room+slot approved
  Pending --> Cancelled : requester cancels
  Pending --> Cancelled : own overlapping request approved
  Pending --> Expired : undecided at slot − 2 h
  Approved --> Cancelled : requester or admin cancels\n(< 6 h before → logged)
  Approved --> Cancelled : admin keeps clashing routine class
  Approved --> Used : slot passes
  Used --> NoShowNoted : admin adds no-show note
  Rejected --> [*]
  Expired --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
  Used --> [*]
  NoShowNoted --> [*]
